<title>CANADA: CANADIAN GAS ASSOC STORAGE SURVEY - AUG 1.</title>
<headline>CANADIAN GAS ASSOC STORAGE SURVEY - AUG 1.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended August 1:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 08/01/97  07/25/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	    120.30    110.58     51.7	47.6	51.3</p>
<p>West	    157.26    147.26     60.0	57.3	63.7</p>
<p>Total Canada  277.56    257.83     56.1	52.7	58.1</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 08/01/97: 232.55 bcf, 07/25/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
